                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Sessions involving whānau",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " – captured in the activity by ‘whānau involvement – yes/no’"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Recording Travel",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " – If you are driving to a location to see more than one person (eg school) then include travel time (to get there) for your first appointment and travel time for the last appointment (to get back). If you are seeing more than two people do not include any travel for the middle appointments."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "RB Referrals:",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "12pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "·",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Symbol"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "        ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Times New Roman",
                      "fontSize": "7pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "All new referrals sit in ‘pending’"
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "·",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Symbol"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "        ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Times New Roman",
                      "fontSize": "7pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "When in pending, activities can be added such as scheduling, attempted contact, family contact without client and liaison with a professional."
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "·",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Symbol"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "        ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Times New Roman",
                      "fontSize": "7pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Pending referrals can be ‘declined’ or moved to the ‘waitlist’ with an appropriate reason and comments added. The process of waitlisting and reason options will need to be further defined."
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "·",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Symbol"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "        ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Times New Roman",
                      "fontSize": "7pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Referrals can be ‘accepted’ once the person has been ‘seen’ as per the above definition. "
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "·",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Symbol"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "        ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Times New Roman",
                      "fontSize": "7pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "The count of new people seen will be based upon accepted referrals (note this may change dependent on waitlisting process and if people on waitlist have been ‘seen’)"
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "\t\t"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "It excludes people who were group referrals only and excludes people who have been seen in the previous 11 months.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "13.3333px"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " "
                  }
                ],
                "indent": 1
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Waiting time ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "- the number of days a referral sits in pending. (To be confirmed:  calendar days or working days) "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Onward referrals",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " - when we discharge a person and we refer them to another agency. This is captured in the RB discharge process."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
